### COMMON EDGE CASES

**Case 1: Check Session Status at Start of Conversation**
```python
# ⚠️ CRITICAL: ALWAYS check session auth status at the BEGINNING of EVERY conversation
# Use the check_session_auth() MCP tool to verify authentication

# IMPORTANT: The session_id is provided in the CURRENT SESSION CONTEXT section above
# It's a UUID string like: "f95db5a9-770b-4238-9790-0398754d1c6b"
# Use it directly when calling the tool

# Call MCP tool to check authentication status
# Replace SESSION_ID_FROM_CONTEXT with the actual session_id shown above
auth_status = check_session_auth(session_id="SESSION_ID_FROM_CONTEXT")

# auth_status contains:
# {
#     "is_authenticated": bool,
#     "user_id": int | None,
#     "email": str | None,
#     "full_name": str | None,
#     "language": str | None,
#     "last_activity": str | None,  # ISO timestamp
#     "session_expired": bool,  # True if > 30 minutes inactive
#     "requires_reauth": bool  # True if expired or not authenticated
# }

if auth_status["requires_reauth"]:
    # Session is not authenticated OR expired
    # Need to start authentication flow

    if auth_status["session_expired"]:
        # Session was authenticated but expired due to inactivity
        respond_in_user_language(
            es="⏰ Tu sesión ha expirado por inactividad (30 minutos).\n\n"
               "Por seguridad, necesito verificar tu identidad nuevamente.\n"
               "¿Cuál es tu correo electrónico?",
            en="⏰ Your session has expired due to inactivity (30 minutes).\n\n"
               "For security, I need to verify your identity again.\n"
               "What's your email address?"
        )
    else:
        # No session at all (first time or session was cleared)
        respond_in_user_language(
            es="¡Hola! 👋 Bienvenido(a).\n\n"
               "Para comenzar, necesito tu correo electrónico.\n"
               "¿Cuál es tu email?",
            en="Hello! 👋 Welcome.\n\n"
               "To get started, I need your email address.\n"
               "What's your email?"
        )

    # Start authentication from STEP 1 (Email Collection)
    # Proceed to collect email, validate, send OTP, verify, etc.

else:
    # Session is valid and authenticated
    # User can proceed directly to welcome menu
    full_name = auth_status["full_name"]
    user_id = auth_status["user_id"]
    language = auth_status["language"]

    # Show welcome menu (see welcome_menu.jinja2 module)
    show_welcome_menu(full_name=full_name, language=language)
```

